1
00:00:02,919 --> 00:00:07,070
Lesson 16 Bob brings the cookies to the village market.

2
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:09,769
Bob brings Carol the cookies.

3
00:00:10,339 --> 00:00:14,730
He tells Carol that baking the cookies was easy because he had lots of help.

4
00:00:16,119 --> 00:00:18,689
Bob, how did the baking go?

5
00:00:19,539 --> 00:00:22,609
Slow at first, but we're getting the hang of it.

6
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:27,129
Once you learn the ropes, it becomes second nature.

7
00:00:27,679 --> 00:00:32,890
To tell you the truth, I thought that baking 2,000 cookies would be a pain in the neck,

8
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:37,049
but we managed to round up some helpers, and it was a piece of cake.

9
00:00:38,379 --> 00:00:41,429
Well, thanks for coming in person with the cookies.

10
00:00:42,039 --> 00:00:44,729
No problem. When will you need more?

11
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:48,689
It depends on how many we sell today.

12
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:51,369
How many do you think you'll sell?

13
00:00:53,019 --> 00:00:56,289
Maybe 500, maybe 2,000.

14
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:58,670
Your guess is as good as mine.

15
00:00:59,359 --> 00:01:01,890
In any case, I'll keep you posted.

16
00:01:02,759 --> 00:01:06,070
Okay, just give me a ring as soon as you know.

